title: Merging step by step
code:
```python
left = [1, 4]
right = [2, 3]
merged = []
i = 0
j = 0
while i < len(left) and j < len(right):
    if left[i] <= right[j]:
        merged.append(left[i])
        i += 1
    else:
        merged.append(right[j])
