```python
def merge_sort_by(records, key):
    out = records[:]
    for i in range(1, len(out)):
        item = out[i]
        j = i - 1
        while j >= 0 and out[j][key] > item[key]:
            out[j + 1] = out[j]
            j -= 1
        out[j + 1] = item
    return out
```
